Reading this table: a NEGATIVE median margin means the best wrong setting outscores
the truth, so a full sweep would rank noise above signal at that length no matter
how much compute it is given. Positive margin is the precondition for the
ciphertext-only attack to be able to work at all.

At 72 letters the best order tested is n=4 with median margin -0.0532.
Still NEGATIVE. Raising n-gram order does not lift the truth above the decoy maximum at this length, which is consistent with the wall being a shortage of information in 72 letters rather than a shortage of model.
